{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["<b>And he shall burn the garment, or the warp, or the woof.</b> And it further says <b>(v. 53) and behold, the plague has not spread in the garment, or in the warp, or in the woof.</b> And it further says <b>(v. 56) and he shall tear it out of the garment, or out of the skin, or out of the warp, or out of the woof.</b> The Ramban explained that the reason Scripture mentions many times, in several verses, 'in the garment, or the skin, and the warp, and the woof,' is by way of the plain sense (peshat), to make known that it is a miraculous matter."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:25:16.842445663Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}